 "title": "How to increase the chances of success? Zen quotes",
 "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">How to increase the chances of success? Zen quotes</span></span></h2><h2><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Hi everyone, today I would like to share some zen quotes that help us to increase the chances of success in our life.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />Zen's\n quotes are not belong or dedicated to a certain religious people. It’s \nfor all people around the world. </span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgRgyOxgv7Znp2ST7X0hso3W_waB6jLgRwyzCfb86CGGAUJD9nMWOR0LanhVi1K1WoDZeQfuC8jQ9ptZnhM8vcLumhzVh98FO8idcxSQnAWwhZZKsSyWUtIb7S0mh_4hpxcZw3bEZaRmDVzKU6PObDCt6ugeDTIIlxn96TzJTTdG0s0tD8FxrfLwtI8eQ=s6000\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3376\" data-original-width=\"6000\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgRgyOxgv7Znp2ST7X0hso3W_waB6jLgRwyzCfb86CGGAUJD9nMWOR0LanhVi1K1WoDZeQfuC8jQ9ptZnhM8vcLumhzVh98FO8idcxSQnAWwhZZKsSyWUtIb7S0mh_4hpxcZw3bEZaRmDVzKU6PObDCt6ugeDTIIlxn96TzJTTdG0s0tD8FxrfLwtI8eQ=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />Zen's\n quotes are mostly following by Chinese and people who follows Buddhism. \nQuotes are popular in Tibet, China, Japan. Most of the schools in China \nteaches zen quotes to the student from the very early stages of their \nschooling, it helps them to have a clear thought about life and \nenlighten their future vision.</span><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />We can’t be able to control our mind \nat easier ways. Once a reporter asks Rahul Dravid (Indian \ncricketer),” Take your wicket during the test matches is nearly close to\n the impossible, what is that secret?” Dravid replied “I don’t care \nabout how many overs I could play, I only care about the ball I \ncurrently I have to hit. It shows his stability of his mind. Zen quotes \nteach us how to be make stable our mind and attain inner peace.</span><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjJKyMtQqGMGHfAwxOGBvUUvEgWuTZP4y_MEROubAWkJ5WSILyyGdyv62Gp0BIRMxid3p0X5EVzjAF_TFvkWSMnfO40qlDmRnjFLz_BCyEIvLYvNxDHDxXJgkxxOtk_BMk_EhvhTd1dlTvCJakU6VueG-rOTCdAqXGQAVqZSyjULtHCwljOKSq2rnIOMQ=s3272\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2179\" data-original-width=\"3272\" height=\"213\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjJKyMtQqGMGHfAwxOGBvUUvEgWuTZP4y_MEROubAWkJ5WSILyyGdyv62Gp0BIRMxid3p0X5EVzjAF_TFvkWSMnfO40qlDmRnjFLz_BCyEIvLYvNxDHDxXJgkxxOtk_BMk_EhvhTd1dlTvCJakU6VueG-rOTCdAqXGQAVqZSyjULtHCwljOKSq2rnIOMQ=s320\" width=\"320\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><br />Following zen quotes could help us to control out thoughts and emotions. Let’s see.<br /></span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Empty our mind.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Empty\n our mind means make your mind thoughtless.It can’t be able to achieve \nin a day. We should practice regularly to achieve this. “Practice makes a\n man perfect”. Every time you practice you will get better scope. Don’t \nthink about the hateful things and rush your mind towards useless \ncomplications. Yoga helps us to calm our mind. Try to wake up early in \nthe morning and have a small walk to breath fresh air and have a little \ntalk with your neighbors that help to lighten our morning tensions. Work\n for your continuous improvement without blaming others, your \nsurrounding atmosphere will change automatically.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimTTMfwQLJ5fbw26WTCypkJv8-b5-96ERUciJVj2X73ZA7gilxa-wV12rM2E6crmFSimk8NH4-cRIUargdXayw8sboiIUvfOxtl8qYM7HHSfjtYXwgB39lvV0k6fZA-LrZIMnOWInCzCR6GlmldjkrD1SHBnSXsE928nOHCKRKjbLIR9lVj3i4LdnS9Q=s3565\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3565\" data-original-width=\"2674\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEimTTMfwQLJ5fbw26WTCypkJv8-b5-96ERUciJVj2X73ZA7gilxa-wV12rM2E6crmFSimk8NH4-cRIUargdXayw8sboiIUvfOxtl8qYM7HHSfjtYXwgB39lvV0k6fZA-LrZIMnOWInCzCR6GlmldjkrD1SHBnSXsE928nOHCKRKjbLIR9lVj3i4LdnS9Q=s320\" width=\"240\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><br /><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #04ff00;\"><span style=\"color: #2b00fe;\"><u><b><span style=\"font-family: times;\">please disable adblocker and allow us to show some advertisements.</span></b></u></span></span></span></i></span></span></i></h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Slow down your thought waves.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Our\n mind thoughts are like an offshore sea wave, it is on a rush in all \ntimes without take rest. Increasing thoughts lead to increase in \ntension. So practice slowing down your thought waves and try to calm our\n mind in all times. Think about the present moment and give your best \nefforts for the present time, your future will automatically change into\n beautiful.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ55u0MagYpggcdcWb5NUByf6O9OMDE4vWpPs6eKKddHYV7pLhYDMfXIAQiHJ4TFy08nyPzvBoxNHmks1gw2SF2jtDT--hAW89igd3IhAPTJZnLxLMvg4J5kEoqDWQYG3U30j58ler-ZNQMSZqORDsQRld6JFYw8gPX2v69TyDJXZEKSJQmmG6-697_w=s4032\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4032\" data-original-width=\"3024\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiQ55u0MagYpggcdcWb5NUByf6O9OMDE4vWpPs6eKKddHYV7pLhYDMfXIAQiHJ4TFy08nyPzvBoxNHmks1gw2SF2jtDT--hAW89igd3IhAPTJZnLxLMvg4J5kEoqDWQYG3U30j58ler-ZNQMSZqORDsQRld6JFYw8gPX2v69TyDJXZEKSJQmmG6-697_w=s320\" width=\"240\" /></a></span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/2021/12/the-mental-toughness-guide-how-to.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><b>The Mental Toughness Guide: How to Develop Unbreakable Inner Strength!!!. </b></span></a><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><b>🤔</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Consistent and hard work are the base pillar for the success.</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"></span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Don’t\n be overconfident about your skills and don’t underestimate your skills.\n Learn to lead the life between success and failures. Give your \ncontinuous efforts and hard work to the present and don’t care about the\n outcome. “Do your best and leave the rest”.<br /><br /></span></span><br /><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/2022/01/step-to-step-process-to-achieve-new.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><u><i><b>Step to Step process to achieve new year resolution:</b></i></u></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\"><u><i><b>😲</b></i></u></span></span><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg076yCn4RNdpuqmFVqB92NW9ldyTlv5JCaH041twN4mvuutzq6Fxz_0qgARG1ZnAxgiL_cd68lTuTuNlYqxk-woNWFuqD9IJmTIYgtelMKug6G1-EI8MCR38VwWZsxGvncRpBXZQ7jaykMBUJRHU2rhTedpE_bjpI3K1One2McDI8-AYxX2XoHT-_gPA=s4498\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"4498\" data-original-width=\"3000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg076yCn4RNdpuqmFVqB92NW9ldyTlv5JCaH041twN4mvuutzq6Fxz_0qgARG1ZnAxgiL_cd68lTuTuNlYqxk-woNWFuqD9IJmTIYgtelMKug6G1-EI8MCR38VwWZsxGvncRpBXZQ7jaykMBUJRHU2rhTedpE_bjpI3K1One2McDI8-AYxX2XoHT-_gPA=s320\" width=\"213\" /></a></span></div><br /><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://randomthoughtsever.blogspot.com/p/trending-posts_53.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #351c75;\"><u><i><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia;\">Trending posts..😲😵click here!!!</span></span></i></u></span></a></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><br /></span></p><div><p><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><i><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u><span><i><span style=\"color: red;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>Thanks for reading this blog,please share with others and help us to grow<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">.</span></span></span></b></span></i></span></u></span></span></i><i><span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><br /><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b><br /></b></u></span></span></span></i></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-family: times;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><i><span><span><span style=\"color: red;\"><u><b>Please visit this blog again!!!we uploads articles daily!!!!😀😀</b></u></span></span></span></i></span></span></h2></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span><p></p>",
